        "between": [
          "In 2020, 13 Member States generously made contributions",
          "to the CFE totaling almost US$ 23 million (Table 3).",
          "Austria joined the list of contributors for the first time.",
          "Contributions dropped from the previous two years.",
          "This was likely to be as a result of the exceptional focus",
          "last year on addressing and fully funding the COVID-19",
          "response (Figure 3). See Annex 3 for a complete list",
          "of CFE contributors since 2015.",
          "TOTAL US$ 159.5",
          "Figure 3  CFE contributions 2015–2020 (million)"
